abstract: >
  A PRISMA 2020-compliant systematic review of 97 primary RS-MLLM papers
  (plus 113 contextual references, 210 total retrieved), covering 26 distinct
  RS-MLLM architectures. Proposes a five-dimensional design space and
  three-type hallucination taxonomy. Identifies cross-sensor OBB and
  spectral reasoning as the two most critical open gaps.
